  "title": "Articulation manifest with a Godot runtime joint builder",
  "purpose": "Give a glTF asset working hinges and sliders: a manifest binds joints (axis, pivot, limits) to named nodes, a checker validates the binding and predicts poses at the limits, and a Godot 4 node applies it at run time with clamping, clips and a saved scene.",
